00:06:36,768 --> 00:06:42,212
Before that, we would like to review our concept Photovoltaic effect.

48
00:06:42,850 --> 00:07:11,652
Photovoltaic effect is a widely known effect in, uh, in the light, in the lighting theory, and, uh, there is a PN junction in the light, in the LED, and there is a famous example of using photoelectric effect and to, uh, to make a light when we applied the voltage, and the photovoltaic effect is a reverse process.

49
00:07:11,990 --> 00:07:19,684
It means once upon exposure to the light, the body and current will be created on the PN junction.

50
00:07:20,974 --> 00:07:31,332
So, given this, we have been run a preliminary study to characterize the reaction of the pin junction to the screen exposure.

51
00:07:31,968 --> 00:07:49,476
So we uh we uh we impose the PN injunction uh prototype in front of we use uh LEDs, the RDB LED, and the solar cell, the pin junction inside to build the prototype.

