00:07:49,870 --> 00:07:53,860
And then we test it on multiple different lighting conditions.

53
00:07:54,688 --> 00:08:09,316
from the figures here we can see once the pin junction is facing the screen light, then there is a charging and discharging process, which is a photovoltaic effect.

54
00:08:10,094 --> 00:08:16,036
So based on this phenomenon, we would like to develop our technology, our solution.

55
00:08:16,814 --> 00:08:19,492
