60
00:09:03,982 --> 00:09:17,250
because this is a very low-duty cycle sensing task, and the battery lifetime can last more than 30 hours, and the total weight of the wearable part is 50 grams.

61
00:09:17,728 --> 00:09:25,408
the size is 30 by 32 by 8 millimeters, and the entire prototype cost is less than $10.

