00:11:08,174 --> 00:11:17,380
And here from the features illustration, we can see the discharge pattern shows different features upon the screen exposure.

74
00:11:18,126 --> 00:11:36,676
And the last part is the screen detection algorithm, and the input is the features from the pin junction discharge pattern, and uh it employs a tree-like structure which has two levels cascaded SVM, and the kernel function used here is the Gaussian radium basis.

